  1D8:  			Default
  1E0:  				Call  DisablePartnerAI  ( 00000000 )
  1F0:  				Wait  1`
  1FC:  				Call  SpeakToPlayer     ( .Npc:Partner 00040006 00040001 00000005 *Var9 ) % variable string ID
